{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 65, :comments ["<b>You shall find no repose.</b> You shall not rest, as in ״וְזֹאת הַמַּרְגֵּעָה״ (Isaiah 28)." "<b>An anxious heart.</b> A trembling heart, as the Targum renders: דָּחֵל — as in ״שְׁאוֹל מִתַּחַת רָגְזָה לָךְ״ (Isaiah 14), ״שָׁמְעוּ עַמִּים יִרְגָּזוּן״ (Exodus 15), ״מוֹסְדוֹת הַשָּׁמַיִם יִרְגָּזוּ״ (II Samuel 22)." "<b>And failing of the eyes.</b> Expecting salvation and it does not come."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:48:46.298456493Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}